    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d774">

                <pb facs="0891" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg795"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ask if Venezuelan Government is disposed to grant permission for naval vessel of
                    the United States to survey bar at the mouth of the Orinoco River in the
                    interest of general commerce. Early answer desired, as Navy Department is
                    prepared to begin survey at once.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
